// # std/qa — Self-Test Probe Index
//
// Logline: Index of std self-test probe drivers.
//
// Setup: Each probe exercises one of the 8 domains. If a probe fails, the std package fails to release.
//
// Beats:
//   1. probe_core.oo — verify core/ primitives (list, map, math, encoding, format)
//   2. probe_fs.oo — verify fs/ file ops
//   3. probe_net.oo — verify net/ socket ops
//   4. probe_sec.oo — verify sec/ sha3 (real Keccak, not DJB2)
//   5. probe_science.oo — verify science/ bio/chem/phys/econ
//   6. probe_app.oo — verify app/ ai/robot/ui/data
//   7. probe_hw.oo — verify hw/ silicon/gpu/mem
//   8. probe_meta.oo — verify meta/ test/diag
//   9. probe_api_surface.oo — verify std anchor.oo exposes exactly 8 public subdirs
//   10. probe_caps.oo — verify caller capability tokens and permissions
//   11. probe_cap_grant.oo — verify 20 subset of 26 cap inventory
//   12. probe_cap_fs.oo — verify &FsReadCap and &FsWriteCap filesystem operations
//   13. probe_cap_process.oo — verify &ProcessCap, &EnvCap, and &SysCap execution
//   14. probe_cap_system.oo — verify &TimeCap, &RandCap, and &AllocCap system operations
//   15. probe_cap_net.oo — verify &TcpCap network operations
//   16. probe_cap_falsify.oo — negative-trust compile-time cap_deny falsification
//   17. probe_data.oo — verify data/database pure pieces (btree, page header, stmt kinds, certs)
//   18. probe_wal_disk.oo — verify on-disk WAL (fsync round-trip, torn-tail refusal, kill-recover modes)
//   19. probe_sql_exec.oo — verify real SQL executor (insert/select/update/delete round-trip, true counts)
//   20. probe_sandbox_m1.oo — verify sec/sandbox engine: backend probe, config matrix, positive apply
//   21. probe_sandbox_adv1.oo — adversarial sandbox configs: bad paths, huge fds, fail-closed refusals
//   22. probe_sandbox_stress.oo — real Landlock confinement: allowed rw vs kernel-denied read/write
//   23. probe_swarm.oo — verify actor cells, bounded mailboxes, fuel accounting, and OTP supervision in memory
//   24. probe_cap_env.oo — verify 8 capability dimensions for &EnvCap under Negative Trust
//   25. suite.oo runs the wired probes twice under double-run discipline (see suite.oo).
//   26. probe_ed25519.oo — verify sec/asymmetric ed25519 against RFC 8032 oracle vectors.
//   27. probe_sec_kat.oo — verify sha256/sha512/hmac against FIPS 180-4 and RFC 4231 vectors.
//   28. probe_curve25519.oo — verify curve25519 scalarmult against RFC 7748 vectors.
//   29. probe_mac_kat.oo — verify hkdf/pbkdf2/totp against RFC 5869/6238 vectors.
//   30. probe_num_format.oo — verify integer formatting incl. INT64 edges.
//   31. probe_fs_ops.oo — verify fs walk/copy/link/remove incl. containment.
//   32. probe_sym_kat.oo — verify chacha20/poly1305/aes against RFC 8439 and FIPS-197 vectors.
//   33. probe_net_kat.oo — verify net URL/IP/DNS/HTTP/WS/MIME/cookie parsers.
//   34. probe_net_cidr.oo — verify CIDR parse and containment (single-use: oodac ARC).
//   35. probe_camera_2d.oo — verify 2D camera transform math.
//   36. probe_canvas.oo — verify canvas paint primitives.
//   37. probe_cube_3d.oo — verify cube projection math.
//   38. probe_flare_2d.oo — verify lens flare (hdr_add purity pinned).
//   39. probe_font_5x7.oo — verify 5x7 glyph rasterization.
//   40. probe_font_big.oo — verify big font rasterization.
//   41. probe_hdr_3d.oo — verify HDR framebuffer ops.
//   42. probe_noise_2d.oo — verify value-noise determinism.
//   43. probe_particle_2d.oo — verify particle integration.
//   44. probe_pixel_fx.oo — verify pixel effects.
//   45. probe_pixel.oo — verify pixel pack/unpack.
//   46. probe_post_2d.oo — verify fog/bloom post passes.
//   47. probe_ppm.oo — verify PPM byte-exact sink.
//   48. probe_qoi_file.oo — verify QOI container framing.
//   49. probe_raster_3d.oo — verify software triangle raster.
//   50. probe_raster_tex.oo — verify textured raster.
//   51. probe_ray_3d.oo — verify ray-sphere math.
//   52. probe_shade_3d.oo — verify lighting math.
//   53. probe_shadow_3d.oo — verify shadow projection.
//   54. probe_spin_3d.oo — verify rotation math.
//   55. probe_tilemap_2d.oo — verify tilemap blit.
//   56. probe_vector_2d.oo — verify 2D vector ops.
//   57. probe_wave_2d.oo — verify 2D wave synthesis.
//   58. probe_wave_3d.oo — verify 3D wave synthesis.
//   59. probe_xform_2d.oo — verify 2D transform stack.
//
// probe_sdl_* are excluded by suite.oo with a tripwire: they pass check
// but the LLVM backend has no ffi_call codegen (emit-llvm fails with
// 'unknown call ffi_call'). This is a compiler limitation, not a display
// issue — xvfb cannot help. If a probe ever builds, the suite fails so
// it gets wired into the double-run set. Wiring them for real needs
// ffi_call codegen (oodac) plus Xvfb + signed SDL lib in CI.

